# Rust/Cargo Packages
# Rust packages installed via Cargo
# Install with: bin/manifest list rust | xargs -n1 cargo install

# ============================================================================
# Cargo Utilities
# ============================================================================
cargo-cache                            # Inspect and prune the global cargo cache.
cargo-update                           # `cargo install-update -a` — updates cargo-installed binaries; used by dotfiles-update.

